WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:01.839
(car engine revving)

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:04.916
- You don't have to, like, move yourself.

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:06.494
(tires squealing)

00:00:06.494 --> 00:00:07.991
(car crashes)

00:00:07.991 --> 00:00:10.980
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:18.521
(clock ticking)

00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:20.820
(alarm beeping)

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.992
- Hmm, can I go to the gym?

00:00:22.992 --> 00:00:25.846
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:29.392
(energetic game music)

00:00:31.032 --> 00:00:33.906
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:33.906 --> 00:00:35.161
- Well, what are you getting

00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:36.403
Devon for her birthday?

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.701
- A GTX 780 graphics processor.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:40.003
It should improve her render time

00:00:40.003 --> 00:00:41.859
by like 15%.

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:45.001
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:45.001 --> 00:00:47.368
- My choice for MVP is Prince Fielder.

00:00:47.368 --> 00:00:48.508
- Oh, my God.

00:00:48.508 --> 00:00:50.004
That guy's a total glass cannon.

00:00:50.004 --> 00:00:51.583
I mean, with a horrible DPS,

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.266
like, maybe if he had the taking

00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:55.681
power of a barbarian
he'd be a decent player,

00:00:55.681 --> 00:00:57.341
but I wouldn't recommend

00:00:57.341 --> 00:00:58.850
putting him on the field.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.390
(upbeat techno music)

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.654
- Oh, good play, good play, good play.

00:01:04.654 --> 00:01:07.301
No, no, what are you doing?

00:01:07.301 --> 00:01:09.321
Oh, my God.

00:01:09.321 --> 00:01:10.657
- You watching the game?

00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:12.375
(indistinct speech)

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:15.230
(upbeat techno music)

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:16.949
[Both] Five nights at Freddie's.

00:01:16.949 --> 00:01:18.028
- You play?

00:01:18.028 --> 00:01:19.874
- I play, of course I play.

00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:22.807
(upbeat techno music)

00:01:23.914 --> 00:01:25.435
- It is up to you

00:01:25.435 --> 00:01:27.815
to roll a 15 in order to kill

00:01:27.815 --> 00:01:30.276
the last knoll.

00:01:30.276 --> 00:01:32.009
- I didn't want to have to do this.

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.413
(dice clanking on table)

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.715
(ominous thud)

00:01:37.715 --> 00:01:40.285
(upbeat techno music)

00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:43.212
(car engine revving)

00:01:43.212 --> 00:01:44.983
(upbeat techno music)

